Stark  ○┌ Keys ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
1  Conve│Esc     stop the live run     q       quit (asks)      Ctrl-Q  quit now                               │
Ask Star│Ctrl-C  kill switch   Ctrl-L  redraw           x       stop the selected run                          │
i or a s│1 2 3   focus pane    Tab     next pane        < >     resize split                                   │
        │i / a   compose       :       command line     /       search thread                                  │
        │f       follow live   ,       settings         ?       this help                                      │
        │j k     move          gg / G  first / last     Enter   activate                                       │
        │Ctrl-N  new conversation      t       sessions                                                        │
        │v       dictate       Ctrl-V  dictate (insert) m       listen on/off                                  │
        │Insert: Enter sends · Alt-Enter or Ctrl-J newline · Esc leaves insert                                 │
        │While a turn runs: Enter steers it — the message reaches the turn at the                              │
        │        next step, and is sent as a new turn if that one just ended.                                  │
        │        Esc leaves insert, Esc again stops the run; what it already did stays.                        │
        │Prompts: Enter saves · Ctrl-U clears a pre-filled value · Esc cancels                                 │
        │On a card: y / n answer a confirm once it is on screen · j k pick · 1-9 answer · i types              │
        │Settings: s set key · x remove key · K check key · c sign in · d sign out                             │
        │          r refresh models · Enter toggles a bool or cycles a choice                                  │
        │                                                                                                      │
        │the : line                                                                                            │
        │  :nav      <url> <goal> [--headless] [--profile P] [--no-safety]drive a web page to a goal           │
        │  :app      <app> <goal>                                  drive a native application to a goal        │
        │  :ax       trusted|apps|table|press|set|menu|type|key    one direct accessibility call               │
        │  :eval     [--filter F] [--tag T] [--once] [--list]      run the app-control suite                   │
        │  :stop                                                   cancel the selected run — Esc, while live   │
        │  :kill                                                   cancel every live run                       │
        │  :new      [title]                                       start a conversation                        │
        │  :sessions                                               switch conversation                         │
        │  :rename   <title>                                       retitle this conversation                   │
        │  :settings [section]                                     open Settings                               │
        │  :keys                                                   open Connections & keys                     │
        │  :models   [refresh]                                     open Models, or re-read the catalogue       │
        │  :doctor                                                 re-run the readiness checks                 │
        │  :help                                                   the keymap                                  │
        │  :quit                                                   leave — the key is Ctrl-Q                   │
        │  :packs                                                  capability packs — not built yet            │
        │  :soul                                                   edit soul.md — not built yet                │
        │  :pause                                                  pause the queue — not built yet             │
        │  :resume                                                 resume the queue — not built yet            │  ▼ live
> Enter │  :listen   on|off                                        microphone — not built yet                  │
NORMAL │└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
